      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Infectious Devotion",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "divine",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "20 feet. When a creature ends its turn in the aura, it must attempt a DC 31 Will save save (a plant or fungus takes a –2 circumstance penalty to this save). If the creature fails, it becomes Stupefied 1 for 1 minute (Stupefied 2 on a critical failure) as the fungus leshy's spores take root on the flesh and send unwelcome and distracting thoughts of devotion to Treerazer into the victim's mind.",
